# NAME: Parsec P2P
# AUTHOR: Horatio Xu
# FORMAT: Surge Remote Rule Set
# RULES: 3
# VERSION: 1.0.0
# UPDATED: 2026-10-08
# ASSIGN POLICY: DIRECT
# Put before Parsec proxy rule set.
# PROCESS-NAME parsecd applies on Surge Mac; iOS ignores process rules.
# PORT-FALLBACK: Explicit opt-in at rule/optional/ParsecP2P-Port9000.list.
# Rule matching does not guarantee P2P can traverse NAT/firewalls.
# DATA-AUDITED: 2026-11-13; see Docs/Audit-2026-11-13.md.
# OFFICIAL-REVIEW: 2026-11-13; Docs/Official-Optimization-2026-11-13.md

DOMAIN,stun.parsec.app
DOMAIN,stun6.parsec.app
AND,((PROCESS-NAME,parsecd),(PROTOCOL,UDP))
